Better Ping Display for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Better Ping Display (1.2.0) by Vlad Marica (Quintinity).
Original source: https://github.com/vladmarica/better-ping-display-fabric
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the player-list ping rendering, latency colour
interpolation, and configuration handling are implemented in Rust on Sunrise's
typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the
same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

Assets carried from the original repository under the MIT licence:
- icon.png (from assets/betterpingdisplay/icon.png)
- assets/betterpingdisplay/lang/en_us.json
